1
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,430
These are...

2
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,560
But how did they get here?

3
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:39,030
It doesn't make sense.

4
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,130
Uh?

5
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,760
That's impossible.

6
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,430
Isn't it?

7
00:00:50,510 --> 00:00:52,130
How did he get in here?

8
00:01:02,150 --> 00:01:03,610
Mister Song.

9
00:01:03,690 --> 00:01:08,200
This means, they had to shut the
broadcast down for something, right?

10
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,990
Hm.

11
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:13,120
But why?
What's happening over there?

12
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:19,250
It's no good. Too much
confusion at the scene.

13
00:01:19,330 --> 00:01:22,290
There must be a way
to confirm their status.

14
00:01:22,370 --> 00:01:24,250
Gather all the intel we can.

15
00:01:24,330 --> 00:01:25,490
Yes, sir.

16
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:28,180
Director!

17
00:01:28,260 --> 00:01:31,930
So many viewers are calling in at once
that it's crashing the phone system!

18
00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:34,140
They're demanding
we resume the broadcast!

19
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:36,020
And we would if we could!

20
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:40,240
But in case you haven't noticed, we
lost contact, so there's nothing to show!

21
00:01:40,820 --> 00:01:44,590
Besides, what do we do if all
the S-ranks are already dead?

22
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,900
Hey! What's going on?

23
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:51,070
We need an update, right now!

24
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:53,240
-Are you still alive out there?
-Damn it!

25
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,040
My camera quit working!

26
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:57,370
Of all the times?

27
00:01:57,450 --> 00:01:58,750
Iron!

28
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,100
Go.

29
00:02:19,220 --> 00:02:21,560
I'm not following any of this.

30
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:23,650
Who are these shadows?

31
00:02:23,730 --> 00:02:25,400
And how did Hunter Sung...

32
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:27,360
even get to the island?

33
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:32,660
Oh, there you are, and just in time.

34
00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:34,320
But how the hell did you...

35
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,290
I can explain it later.

36
00:02:36,370 --> 00:02:38,910
Let's take care of your
wounds in the meantime.

37
00:02:38,990 --> 00:02:40,580
Here, this should help.

38
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:41,870
Huh?

39
00:02:41,950 --> 00:02:45,090
Right. The system
won't let me hand these off.

40
00:02:46,250 --> 00:02:49,260
You summoned that?
Your magic sure is handy.

41
00:02:49,340 --> 00:02:51,100
Hunter Ma.

42
00:02:52,010 --> 00:02:53,720
I need you to open your mouth.

43
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,770
Aah!

44
00:02:58,510 --> 00:03:00,030
That's unreal.

45
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:05,310
I'm healed.

46
00:03:05,390 --> 00:03:07,070
Completely.

47
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:16,990
She's still in bad shape.

48
00:03:17,070 --> 00:03:18,710
Why isn't it working?

49
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:24,420
Damn, just like before, these can't
work when your health is too low.

50
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:26,720
And her aura is getting weaker.

51
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:30,090
Her wounds are too severe
for potions to heal.

52
00:03:30,170 --> 00:03:33,050
We have to leave now.
I can clear a path for us.

53
00:03:33,130 --> 00:03:34,340
-All right.
-Hold on!

54
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:35,850
-Huh?
-Huh?

55
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:42,100
They certainly swarm like
the bugs they are.

56
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:44,710
How are we gonna
take down so many of them?

57
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,900
Chairman Go!

58
00:03:49,980 --> 00:03:51,570
Any news on the strike team?

59
00:03:51,650 --> 00:03:52,690
No. Not yet.

60
00:03:52,770 --> 00:03:56,990
Something's jamming all comms from the
island, but hopefully it's only temporary.

61
00:03:57,070 --> 00:04:00,700
We can't get through to Japanese
command either. Not sure why.

62
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:02,410
Touched base
with the civilian media,

63
00:04:02,490 --> 00:04:05,500
though, and the last thing
they saw was the black ant.

64
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:08,500
It's imperative
we get that signal back.

65
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:11,670
And I want those medic and
retrieval teams ready to move out.

66
00:04:11,750 --> 00:04:13,220
Yes, sir!

67
00:04:16,670 --> 00:04:18,350
You know, Jinchul.

68
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:23,060
This has to be the most I've ever
resented this aging body of mine.

69
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:28,320
Even if I'd be of no help to them,
I wish I could join the fight.

70
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:30,690
Chairman Go.

71
00:04:30,770 --> 00:04:32,440
Instead...

72
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,800
all I can do is pray.

73
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:40,620
Stupid technology!

74
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:45,000
First the feed cuts then the whole dang TV
decides this is the perfect time to break!

75
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:46,080
We're jinxed!

76
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,630
Well, beating it up
won't fix it, honey.

77
00:04:48,710 --> 00:04:50,090
Whatever.

78
00:04:50,170 --> 00:04:52,090
I'll watch it in my room.

79
00:04:52,170 --> 00:04:54,300
Bet my phone will have updates!

80
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:55,800
Maybe.

81
00:04:58,670 --> 00:05:00,640
That girl is so restless.

82
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:04,310
I want answers, so explain.

83
00:05:04,390 --> 00:05:07,110
Goto-san's vital signs
went silent, sir.

84
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:10,610
Right before the signal was cut.

85
00:05:10,690 --> 00:05:14,700
He was confronted by a
powerful enemy, and likely killed.

86
00:05:15,770 --> 00:05:18,570
-And the others?
-We haven't verified.

87
00:05:18,650 --> 00:05:20,240
Well, figure it out!

88
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:23,500
Any further losses
will cost us in the next phase.

89
00:05:24,660 --> 00:05:26,080
On it.

90
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:32,920
Goto got himself killed?

91
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,630
Useless moron.

92
00:05:35,340 --> 00:05:37,890
What in the hell
is happening on that island?

93
00:05:47,140 --> 00:05:50,440
Elites like Igris and Iron
are holding their own.

94
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:53,450
But the foot soldiers
aren't doing so hot.

95
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:57,190
Part of me wants
to boost their numbers.

96
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:59,830
I just wish that
I didn't have an audience.

97
00:06:01,570 --> 00:06:03,240
-New plan.
-Hm?

98
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:05,040
We're not making any progress.

99
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,830
Time to try a more
aggressive strategy.

100
00:06:07,910 --> 00:06:09,540
See that mage?

101
00:06:10,330 --> 00:06:12,840
You all hang back
and stay behind him.

102
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:15,720
My other shadows will
deal with the ant problem.

103
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:20,720
If any of 'em do get past my
soldiers, make them regret it.

104
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,850
Easy enough. We can
handle a plan like that.

105
00:06:23,930 --> 00:06:25,010
For sure!

106
00:06:25,090 --> 00:06:26,810
One last thing.

107
00:06:26,890 --> 00:06:29,730
Please keep what you're about
to see to yourselves.

108
00:06:30,970 --> 00:06:32,780
Uh. Is he?

109
00:06:54,540 --> 00:06:56,500
It came back already?

110
00:06:56,580 --> 00:06:58,960
I thought it went after Goto.

111
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,800
Does that mean he lost?

112
00:07:18,770 --> 00:07:21,950
There was no king outside.

113
00:07:22,030 --> 00:07:23,700
Is he in here?

114
00:07:24,700 --> 00:07:27,210
The one you call king?

115
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:31,660
I can't sense the shadow
I sent with Goto.

116
00:07:31,740 --> 00:07:33,670
Now, I know why.

117
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:35,800
-Uh!
-Wait!

118
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:57,240
Is it you?

119
00:07:58,060 --> 00:08:00,860
Are you the king of humans?

120
00:08:02,190 --> 00:08:03,900
Cute.

121
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:06,620
They got bugs that can talk now.

122
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,910
Human.

123
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:13,120
Quite the remarkable aura.

124
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,670
Huh?

125
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,170
Okay.

126
00:08:21,250 --> 00:08:23,550
But, you're still just a bug.

127
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:25,800
This might be too much even for him!

128
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:27,930
I guess we're about to see.

129
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,100
Uh?!

130
00:08:32,890 --> 00:08:35,600
Director! The feed is up again!

131
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:37,860
Wha... Isn't he the...

132
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,570
It doesn't matter!
Let's just air it!

133
00:08:40,650 --> 00:08:41,690
Sir!

134
00:08:41,770 --> 00:08:44,740
You realize we'll be
broadcasting without any delay!

135
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:47,530
If something happens live,
we've no way to stop it getting out!

136
00:08:47,610 --> 00:08:51,290
We already cut the broadcast once.
Can't get any worse than that!

137
00:08:51,370 --> 00:08:53,080
-Do it!
-Yes! Right!

138
00:08:53,990 --> 00:08:58,130
Our future, the battle, everything.

139
00:08:58,210 --> 00:09:00,220
Is riding on this man!

140
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,380
I can't believe it!

141
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:04,210
Me neither.

142
00:09:04,290 --> 00:09:05,930
He's really there!

143
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:13,140
No...

144
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:15,230
way.

145
00:09:15,310 --> 00:09:16,730
Jinwoo?

146
00:09:16,810 --> 00:09:18,810
He said he was just stepping out!

147
00:09:18,890 --> 00:09:20,150
What the heck?

148
00:09:20,230 --> 00:09:22,110
He better break this habit!

149
00:09:24,150 --> 00:09:25,400
He made it there!

150
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:27,410
Thank you, Hunter Sung!

151
00:09:28,190 --> 00:09:31,160
It's him all right.
But how'd he reach them?

152
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:34,040
Point is he did it,
I don't care how!

153
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,920
Let's put our faith in him!

154
00:09:49,590 --> 00:09:51,680
Why would a mage
type get that close to it?

155
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:54,310
He underestimated that ant's power.

156
00:09:54,390 --> 00:09:56,560
And got clobbered for it!

157
00:09:57,350 --> 00:09:58,640
Weak.

158
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,610
You are no king.

159
00:10:24,290 --> 00:10:26,550
Um. Hey, guys.

160
00:10:27,250 --> 00:10:29,590
Are you sure that
Hunter Sung is a mage?

161
00:10:29,670 --> 00:10:32,510
I'm not sure about anything
when it comes to him.

162
00:10:32,590 --> 00:10:35,230
And I definitely didn't expect this.

163
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:37,850
He's pretty durable.

164
00:10:37,930 --> 00:10:39,860
The exoskeleton maybe?

165
00:10:57,660 --> 00:10:59,410
Their punches are insane!

166
00:10:59,490 --> 00:11:02,630
Even as an A-rank,
I can barely stay on my feet!

167
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:07,300
I might pass out just
from the force of their magic!

168
00:11:12,710 --> 00:11:15,680
Am I being overpowered?

169
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,950
How?

170
00:11:30,230 --> 00:11:32,280
I do not understand.

171
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:35,700
How could a human be so strong?

172
00:12:01,510 --> 00:12:02,890
Poison?

173
00:12:02,970 --> 00:12:07,560
A mixture of toxins,
from the marine life here.

174
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:11,910
Its potency, amplified
by my magic power.

175
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:17,910
You will lose all ability
to move before long.

176
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,500
This is the end for you.

177
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:23,420
Die, human!

178
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:29,960
Seven KIA in a ten-man team?

179
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:31,340
Is that a joke?

180
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:33,550
No. It's the facts.

181
00:12:33,630 --> 00:12:37,680
We were able to contact the three
survivors, and they confirmed it.

182
00:12:39,590 --> 00:12:41,470
We lost over half our hunters?

183
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:44,060
This mission is a catastrophe!

184
00:12:44,140 --> 00:12:48,980
Oh, and, we've also detected a
strong reading near the island's caldera.

185
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:51,690
We think it's whatever
beat Goto-san, sir.

186
00:12:51,770 --> 00:12:54,240
How is it alive after fighting him?

187
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:57,030
And it's headed into the nest? Why?

188
00:12:57,110 --> 00:12:58,320
No idea.

189
00:12:58,400 --> 00:13:00,450
It could have some objective.

190
00:13:00,530 --> 00:13:03,080
Or maybe it needs
a safe place to heal.

191
00:13:04,870 --> 00:13:07,710
We don't know if
the Korean team is alive,

192
00:13:07,790 --> 00:13:12,000
but if they are hanging on by
a thread, Goto's killer will cut it.

193
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:14,050
They'll fall easily in their state,

194
00:13:14,130 --> 00:13:16,890
and the ants will be worn out
from fighting, too.

195
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:22,190
If we can strike down the strong
one, the others will just be fodder.

196
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,810
Victory is not lost!

197
00:13:25,890 --> 00:13:29,400
Hurry up and recover
the three surviving S-ranks!

198
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:33,640
Once they've joined the second strike
team at sea, send them back to the island!

199
00:13:34,690 --> 00:13:38,160
Those are your orders.
A chopper will be there soon.

200
00:13:38,990 --> 00:13:40,370
Roger that.

201
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:44,040
He wants to move ahead
with plan nine.

202
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,580
Let's go.

203
00:13:45,660 --> 00:13:47,500
It's hopeless.

204
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:50,250
That thing is a monster.

205
00:13:50,330 --> 00:13:52,840
If we don't run, then we're history.

206
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:54,840
Get a grip!

207
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,670
No time for panic attacks!

208
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:59,180
Everyone who faced that ant is dead!

209
00:13:59,260 --> 00:14:00,260
All S-ranks!

210
00:14:00,340 --> 00:14:02,600
And you wanna volunteer to be next?

211
00:14:03,890 --> 00:14:05,430
You're pathetic.

212
00:14:05,510 --> 00:14:07,730
We don't have any choice.

213
00:14:07,810 --> 00:14:09,440
Deal with it.

214
00:14:29,950 --> 00:14:31,920
Wait, I thought
he was just poisoned.

215
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:34,260
He seems okay, but is he really?

216
00:14:35,290 --> 00:14:38,720
At this point nothing Hunter
Sung does will surprise me.

217
00:14:39,460 --> 00:14:41,560
So, you had a secret weapon.

218
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:45,650
Ah, I was wondering why
you were holding back earlier.

219
00:14:48,350 --> 00:14:51,770
Maybe it's 'cause my
perception stat's gotten so high.

220
00:14:51,850 --> 00:14:54,400
But I can sense his emotions.

221
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:56,180
He's anxious.

222
00:14:57,020 --> 00:14:58,820
That makes two of us.

223
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:00,490
Huh?

224
00:15:00,570 --> 00:15:02,830
I can't waste any more time.

225
00:15:03,610 --> 00:15:04,990
This ends now!

226
00:15:15,750 --> 00:15:19,470
Poison is ineffective and
tests of strength are pointless.

227
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:21,100
In that case...

228
00:16:35,330 --> 00:16:37,710
Speed that is equal to mine...

229
00:16:38,790 --> 00:16:41,220
...and growing even faster.

230
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:44,470
How is this possible?

231
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:46,200
Upgrade.

232
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:47,740
Mutilation.

233
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,920
What happened?

234
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:00,670
How?

235
00:18:03,790 --> 00:18:06,420
'Course you regenerate.

236
00:18:06,500 --> 00:18:08,220
What was that?

237
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:13,270
What in the world was that?

238
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:41,080
How dare you, you human?

239
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:45,430
You filthy human!

240
00:18:47,420 --> 00:18:50,010
Boys, get 'em.

241
00:19:14,990 --> 00:19:16,370
But...

242
00:19:16,450 --> 00:19:21,250
I was born to be the
absolute strongest being.

243
00:19:21,330 --> 00:19:27,050
I devour all, growing more powerful
with each enemy I consume.

244
00:19:27,130 --> 00:19:29,510
I am supposed to be king.

245
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:32,640
I am supposed to...

246
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:36,050
Run away.

247
00:19:36,130 --> 00:19:37,560
I must run away!

248
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:40,940
In order to survive,
I need to run away!

249
00:19:46,350 --> 00:19:48,530
Get as far as possible!

250
00:20:07,210 --> 00:20:09,100
Hurry! Hurry!

251
00:20:10,170 --> 00:20:11,930
Hurry and escape!

252
00:20:44,450 --> 00:20:45,710
They're running scared.

253
00:20:45,790 --> 00:20:47,330
Can't say I blame them.

254
00:20:47,410 --> 00:20:49,010
Did we just win?

255
00:20:52,500 --> 00:20:54,100
Hunter Sung!

256
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:02,060
Her aura's fading.

257
00:21:02,140 --> 00:21:05,140
We don't have much time
We have to get her to a doctor!

258
00:21:05,220 --> 00:21:07,980
There should be a recovery
helicopter right outside!

259
00:21:08,060 --> 00:21:09,610
-If we go now!
-No.

260
00:21:09,690 --> 00:21:11,320
She won't she'll last that long.

261
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:13,110
So we stay?

262
00:21:16,570 --> 00:21:18,620
Thought your potions
were useless on her.

263
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:20,580
I haven't tried this one.

264
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:28,830
The Elixir of Life even cured
Mom's Eternal Sleep.

265
00:21:28,910 --> 00:21:32,300
This is, this is our last hope!

266
00:21:32,380 --> 00:21:33,840
Huh?

267
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:37,600
No, no.

268
00:21:40,630 --> 00:21:42,230
Did it not work?

269
00:21:44,430 --> 00:21:46,390
I can't leave
the island fast enough.

270
